  "description": "Study at one of Australia’s leading universities in our new state-of-the-art campus, officially opened in 2017.  Located in the centre of the city’s business precinct, the Campus is close to part-time work and internship opportunities, and is just minutes’ walk away from major transport hubs, shopping centres, vibrant café districts and the city's world-renowned icons. With just under 1000 students, the Sydney Campus offers a friendly and supportive community for you to learn and make friends. Our students originate from more than 30 countries and contribute to a rich, multicultural education experience. The Sydney Campus offers foundation studies and diploma programs, along with a range of undergraduate and postgraduate degrees in the areas of Business, Information Technology, Cybersecurity, and Education.",
